              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-accent-primary/10 text-accent-highlight flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold font-mono">01</span>
              <p class="text-text-main/90 text-xs sm:text-[13px] font-semibold font-sans leading-relaxed">
                {isAr ? "عندي لخبطة في حسابات المحل والمخازن ومش عارف أظبطها" : "My store accounts & inventory are a mess, I can't keep track."}
              </p>
            </div>
          </button>

          <!-- Option 2 -->
          <button 
            type="button" 
            data-pain-index="1"
            class="pain-point-card group relative p-5 rounded-2xl border text-start transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer select-none bg-hero-card border-text-main/10 hover:border-accent-primary/30 hover:shadow-[0_4px_20px_var(--color-hero-glow)] active:scale-98"
          >
            <div class="absolute top-4 end-4 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-primary/40 group-hover:bg-accent-primary transition-colors"></div>
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-accent-primary/10 text-accent-highlight flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold font-mono">02</span>
              <p class="text-text-main/90 text-xs sm:text-[13px] font-semibold font-sans leading-relaxed">
                {isAr ? "المبيعات بتقل ومش عارف الإعلانات بتجيب همها ولا لأ" : "Sales are dropping and I don't know if ads are bringing returns."}
              </p>
